#: ../../src/dialogs/ConfigDialogue.cpp:362
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Maxima assigns each command/equation an automatic label (which looks like "
"%i1 or %o1). If a command begins with a descriptive name followed by a : "
"wxMaxima will call the descriptive name a \"user-defined label\" instead. "
"This selection now allows telling wxMaxima whether to show only automatic "
